## Problem Description
SN160 NSE initialization followed by an ordinary trajectory evolution
diagnostic level 1
Issue 40 characterization
## Job Controls
1         Initial Zone
1         # of Zones
1         Include Weak Reactions (yes=1,no=0,only=-1)
0         Include Screening (yes=1)
